	(text "Features:\n- 6-8 Temperature-sensors (2 x I2C, 4-6 OW sensors)\n- 4 x Flow-sensor\n- 2 x 230V gasburner enable + 2 x PWM modulating control\n- 2 x 3 phase electric SSR for HLT and BK\n- 2 x SSR for Pumps\n- 8 x Solenoid Ball Valve control\n- Ethernet RJ45 by Wiz550io\n- Frontpanel LED control by MAX7219"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4568df4b-d9ba-4c42-90e1-aabd28bb9487")
	)
	(text "2.0: First version. PCB made by IteadStudio.\n2.1: Bug-fix PWM generation. R48 and R49 added.\n3.0: Major update: triacs, pcf8574, max1238, con3 (valves) removed,\n     added: flow sensor interface + valves interface.\n3.01: IteadStudio PCB-2 made\n3.02: JP1 for Int./Ext. 24AC switching added\n      MCP23008 with 2 ULN2803 parallel for 1A switching\n3.03: 2 x DS2482 / One-Wire Interface added\n3.04: PTC (Resettable Fuses) added to Valve Interface\n3.05 WIZ550io Interface added\n3.10 Pressure Sensor Interface / -10V removed\n     Sensor Connectors now DIN6-connectors.\n     FLOW2 from D2 to A2, FLOW3 (A1) added.\n     +10V now with DC-DC converter.\n3.20 All Resistors now 1206 SMD. Arduino Nano instead of UNO.\n     LM35 from A0 to A6, FLOW4 added to ADC0.\n     Two One-Wire temp. sensors added (IC11, IC12, CON16, CON17).\n3.21 Temp. sensors now with RJ12 connectors.\n3.30 IC MCP23017 added + Boil PWM interface added.\n     Heater_LED now via triac pcb. SPI_SS from D10 to D7 (PD7).\n3.40 LD1117 footprint added + TD62783 instead of ULN2803.\n     PUMP2_230V added.\n3.50 Solenoid intf now with relays, SMD footprints when possible.\n3.60 VCC-extern now separate from VCC.\n4.00 Arduino replaced by stm8s207R8\n4.01 BK_SSR, HLT_SSR and FLOW4 to other pins\n4.10 Level-shifter MISO + 2x3 ELE SSR  added\n4.11 CH340G + USB added\n4.12 Bug-fix USB connector + DC PWR changed to 24V and 7V + 3V3 separate from 5V\n4.20 KiCad 9 Conversion\n4.21 C50 value 100n->820n\n     U6 address should be 0x36\n     CON7 pin 1 had no Vcc connected\n     TX2/RX2 should be RX3/TX3, also on CON19\n     R44/R51 removed, R25: 10K->18K, C21 added.\n     LM393 / inverted PWM -> normal PWM. \n4.30 KiCad 10 Conversion\n     Wiz550IO orientation changed\n     W5500_Lite added\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 194.31 0)
